# Mission & Vision: Pronounced Neumorphic Redesign

We will update the [MissionVision.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/about/MissionVision.tsx) component to implement a more distinct neumorphic (soft UI) effect on the Mission and Vision cards.

## Proposed Changes

### [Mission & Vision Component]
#### [MODIFY] [MissionVision.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/about/MissionVision.tsx)
-   Implement a stronger dual shadow system for a more "marked" effect.
-   Apply persistent neumorphic shadows to the Mission and Vision cards.
-   Add interactive hover effects on the icon containers, similar to the Benefits section.
-   Ensure background consistency for the neumorphic effect to be effective.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to ensure no UI breakages.

### Manual Verification
- Visual inspection of the more pronounced neumorphic shadows.
- Verify that the cards look deeply integrated into the screen background.
